From 4b5a01bb288e0a2255f178f159ac8b6abab11274 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:33:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: migrate type references to imported types

DMN 1.1 references an imported type by an XML QName (`types:Applicant`)
while DMN 1.2+ uses a FEEL qualified name based on the import's name
(`types.Applicant`). The migration gave imports a generated name and kept
the QName, leaving such type references unresolved.

Name an unnamed import after the namespace prefix bound to its namespace
and rewrite every `typeRef` using that prefix. Imports without a bound
prefix, prefixes containing `-` or `.` (ambiguous in FEEL) and other
type references are left as before.

Closes #60
---
